# v8-ls: written by tools/scorecard --write-fullrange. Holds at throttle 0 every 250 rpm
# from idle (the first hold of holds-t100.scn) to below the limiter at 6800 rpm.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles and 1 s; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
hold 690 0 4.7
sweep 690 1000 0 0.25
hold 1000 0 3.4
sweep 1000 1250 0 0.25
hold 1250 0 2.9
sweep 1250 1500 0 0.25
hold 1500 0 2.5
sweep 1500 1750 0 0.25
hold 1750 0 2.2
sweep 1750 2000 0 0.25
hold 2000 0 2
sweep 2000 2250 0 0.25
hold 2250 0 1.8
sweep 2250 2500 0 0.25
hold 2500 0 1.7
sweep 2500 2750 0 0.25
hold 2750 0 1.6
sweep 2750 3000 0 0.25
hold 3000 0 1.5
sweep 3000 3250 0 0.25
hold 3250 0 1.5
sweep 3250 3500 0 0.25
hold 3500 0 1.5
sweep 3500 3750 0 0.25
hold 3750 0 1.5
sweep 3750 4000 0 0.25
hold 4000 0 1.5
sweep 4000 4250 0 0.25
hold 4250 0 1.5
sweep 4250 4500 0 0.25
hold 4500 0 1.5
sweep 4500 4750 0 0.25
hold 4750 0 1.5
sweep 4750 5000 0 0.25
hold 5000 0 1.5
sweep 5000 5250 0 0.25
hold 5250 0 1.5
sweep 5250 5500 0 0.25
hold 5500 0 1.5
sweep 5500 5750 0 0.25
hold 5750 0 1.5
sweep 5750 6000 0 0.25
hold 6000 0 1.5
sweep 6000 6250 0 0.25
hold 6250 0 1.5
sweep 6250 6500 0 0.25
hold 6500 0 1.5
sweep 6500 6750 0 0.25
hold 6750 0 1.5
